WEBVTT

NOTE Music only. Captions describe the on-screen titles and actions.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
[Instrumental electronic music] Meet Noteesta.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:12.000
Bring your class materials. PDF slides, a recording, and handwritten notes enter the simulated upload. Study materials are selected and prepared.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:21.600
One lesson. Made clear. The sample Study Pill opens. Note chapters change and a reference reveals a source excerpt.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.400
See how it connects. The energy-flow visual shows the inputs and outputs of the Calvin cycle.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.200
Explore in 3D. A chloroplast model rotates, revealing its thylakoid stacks and stroma.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:38.400
Make it stick. A flashcard reveals its answer, then advances to the next question.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.200
Make sense of what you study. Explore the sample at noteesta.com. [Music fades]
